  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "An `appScreenshotSets` resource represents a set of screenshots that you intend to upload to App Store Connect. Create an appScreenshotSets resource as a container for all screenshots associated with a locale and display target, for example, screenshots for Simplified Chinese on an iPhone with a 6.5-inch display. Next, upload individual screenshots using the `app-screenshots` resource.",
          "refs": [
